      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/paul/{size}/5862_2.png",
      "created_at": "2014-04-29T15:05:42.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>To elaborate on what Christopher said, PAX consistently puts on large, well run shows that attract tabletop gaming fans (and potential tabletop gaming fans) in parts of the world where shows of that sort have either never been tried or have failed in the past, and as such they are a fantastic way to connect with existing fans and to make new ones. As long as this all keeps being true, we are very likely to attend every PAX :)</p>",
